# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/RoundTripConnection.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen:       Round Trip Connection
# The connection from Wooden Spoon Passage to
# Haggis Basher Number One that completed the
# Draenen round trip.
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Saturday 19th November by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Recording: ?
# Tape: ?
# Compass: ?
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey roundcon

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

# The survey data

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	7.7	175	0
  2	3	7.4	202	0
  3	4	6.2	165	0
  4	5	9.1	157	0
  5	6	15.0	142	0
  6	7	5.5	183	0
  7	8	2.7	-	down	# Vertical drop down a rift
  8	9	5.3	331	-35
  9	10	3.2	-	down	# Vertical drop
  10	11	1.4	194	0	# Progress along the bottom of a very tight rift
  11	12	6.7	150	0
  12	13	10.6	153	0	# Joins Haggis Basher 1 at Stn 9.

endcentreline
endsurvey
